      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Headache is always a challenging diagnostic exercise but is especially so in patients who have \"the worst headache ever.\" Such a headache should never be automatically dismissed as merely a severe but benign one. A thorough history and careful physical examination are necessary to find evidence of serious disease. If such evidence is present, immediate, aggressive, and thorough evaluation are essential to avoid severe consequences."},
